The published tree vendors no third-party C sources. Redistributable binaries
(including the committed prebuilts under build/) dynamically link host
libraries. Those libraries are not Apache-2.0; their copyrights remain with
their authors. Optional components can be disabled at build time (see doc.md).

This product dynamically links the following libraries when present. Dynamic
linking keeps LGPL libraries replaceable; do not statically link LGPL objects
into a redistributable `shakti` binary without offering relink materials.

