## Emscripten (WebAssembly builds only)

WASM builds (`make wasm`) are produced with the Emscripten toolchain.
Emscripten is copyright the Emscripten authors, MIT / University of
Illinois NCSA Open Source License. https://emscripten.org/
No Emscripten sources are vendored in this tree; only the host
toolchain's output runtime is present in WASM build artifacts.

## JNI (Android / JVM embedding only)

`src/shakti_jni.c` compiles against the host JDK's JNI headers
(`jni.h`), located via `JAVA_HOME` or Homebrew OpenJDK paths in the
Makefile. No JNI headers are vendored in this tree. JNI is part of the
Java platform under its respective platform licenses.

